WEBVTT

00:00:09.029 --> 00:00:10.689
S-Rank Forest Dragon!

00:00:11.039 --> 00:00:12.289
Why is it in this forest?

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:47.859
Thunder?

00:00:48.039 --> 00:00:49.350
Is it going to rain?

00:00:52.119 --> 00:00:55.329
Yeah, the size and color look good.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.140
Is it because I changed to the right fertilizer?

00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:02.280
It's almost harvest time.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.229
OK, done.

00:02:37.229 --> 00:02:39.009
(Top-notch Farmer)

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:42.919
Soil turning, completed. Level 10.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.360
Terrific!

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.650
Hey, Al.

00:02:45.979 --> 00:02:47.000
Testa!

00:02:47.419 --> 00:02:51.419
Look, I've promoted all the farming skills to Level 10.

00:02:51.569 --> 00:02:52.849
Awesome!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.240
You've also recently promoted
your fishing skills to Level 10.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.879
That's because I went to your place and helped.

00:02:58.879 --> 00:03:02.439
No way, I'm a fisherman but your level
is higher than mine. This can't be right.

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:27.810
I remember at that time, you got more fish than I did.

00:03:28.629 --> 00:03:31.069
All Level 10. You must be a top-notch farmer.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.969
It's mostly because I have the blessing of "Growth Boost".

00:03:35.259 --> 00:03:38.810
You've got a blessing. I do envy you.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.099
Integrate farming skills?

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:43.770
I'll give it a shot.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:55.330
To evolve into a "Nature Lover"
and be favored by the world.

00:03:55.919 --> 00:03:56.759
What does that mean?

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.810
Hey, look at your attack power.

00:03:59.379 --> 00:04:01.969
It has become 73,612 points.

00:04:02.349 --> 00:04:04.129
This is too exaggerated.

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:05.580
You're right.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:09.680
More importantly, I have to deliver these
to the market at the royal capital.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.280
More importantly?

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.879
It doesn't seem like it's going to rain.

00:04:19.709 --> 00:04:20.290
This is great.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:25.379
A dragon?

00:04:30.819 --> 00:04:32.829
Damn. We're no match for it at all.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.519
Retreat!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.730
Rally our forces again.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:43.610
I just need to distract it a second.

00:04:44.649 --> 00:04:47.740
High-speed Mowing, vegetable version!

00:04:57.889 --> 00:04:59.220
What was that?

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.529
What happened?

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.910
I can't believe it exploded.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.769
Oh right, it seems my attack power has become greater.

00:05:12.279 --> 00:05:14.079
Even I got freaked out.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.620
Trails of a carriage?

00:05:23.029 --> 00:05:24.230
Who was that?

00:05:26.649 --> 00:05:27.769
OK, next!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.649
I'm Al Wayne, a farmer from Sils Village.

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.040
I came to deliver vegetables.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.209
This is my pass.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:40.500
You're permitted to enter.
Welcome to the Royal Capital of Meigis.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:41.870
Let me go!

00:05:42.939 --> 00:05:44.000
I said let me go!

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.139
So noisy! Shut up!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.269
Stop!

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.160
Get lost!

00:05:48.439 --> 00:05:49.420
Get out of my way!

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:02.529
Boy, let that woman go if you don't want to suffer.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:04.899
You fool!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.490
Behave yourself!

00:06:18.379 --> 00:06:20.639
The power of perception

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:22.790
is quite convenient.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.300
Thank you for saving me.

00:06:29.519 --> 00:06:31.610
What? Oh...

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.069
Oh no, I'm running late.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.180
Wait! At least tell me your name.

00:06:39.329 --> 00:06:41.139
Don't worry about it.

00:06:45.569 --> 00:06:47.870
Oh my, this batch of delivery is nice too.

00:06:48.709 --> 00:06:49.870
I hope to work with you again.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:50.769
Sure.

00:06:53.459 --> 00:06:56.310
I must water the field when I get back.

00:06:56.759 --> 00:06:57.449
Stop!

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.420
Huh? Do I have to show a pass to leave the capital?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.050
Well...

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:06.019
No, I wanted to meet you.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.139
Oh, you're the girl from before...

00:07:08.709 --> 00:07:11.230
I'm the First Princess of the Royal Capital of Meigis,

00:07:11.759 --> 00:07:13.160
Fal-Ys Meigis.

00:07:14.389 --> 00:07:15.259
Nice to meet you.

00:07:15.959 --> 00:07:16.730
Princess?!

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:21.199
What can a mere farmer like me
do for someone as prestigious as you?

00:07:21.689 --> 00:07:25.629
Don't stand on ceremony. Just talk casually.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.290
This is a royal order.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:30.720
Well, what's your name?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:35.620
Well, I'm Al Wayne.

00:07:36.199 --> 00:07:39.629
Al-kun, I want to ask you for a favor.

00:07:40.699 --> 00:07:42.230
Are you willing to serve the royal family?

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:44.279
What?

00:07:44.709 --> 00:07:46.290
Hell no!

00:07:46.889 --> 00:07:50.870
I really want to say that, but if I do, I'll be beheaded.

00:07:51.899 --> 00:07:52.730
What should I do?

00:07:54.939 --> 00:07:55.699
Al-kun?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.240
I am honored to be graced
with such an attractive offer.

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:03.970
Yet, this is too much responsibility
for a farmer such as I to bear.

00:08:04.699 --> 00:08:07.240
Please allow me to humbly decline.

00:08:07.319 --> 00:08:09.180
My apologies.

00:08:09.629 --> 00:08:10.699
Wait!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:16.220
Why did you refuse me?
Working in the royal palace pays well.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:21.600
I don't care about that. I only want
to work on the fields my whole life.

00:08:22.069 --> 00:08:23.329
Well...

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:27.050
There is a huge field nearby the royal capital.

00:08:27.509 --> 00:08:31.569
If you come to the royal palace,
I can gift you a field of 33,000 square meters.

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:33.649
33,000 square meters?

00:08:34.418 --> 00:08:37.418
But why do you want to recruit me so badly?

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:40.980
Because average status of the man
you easily defeated just now

00:08:41.418 --> 00:08:44.789
is as high as 500 points.

00:08:44.789 --> 00:08:44.821
is as high as 500 points.
May I ask what is the general average status?

00:08:44.821 --> 00:08:47.399
May I ask what is the general average status?

00:08:47.809 --> 00:08:48.529
Oh...

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.850
Well, generally, an ordinary person's
average status is 50 points.

00:08:51.919 --> 00:08:55.759
An adventurer's is only 130 points.
The knight or captain's can reach 600 points.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:58.159
The legendary hero is 1,000 points.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:01.669
Can you show me your status, Al-kun?

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.309
I definitely can't show her.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.600
How did the mission go?

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.059
Well,

00:09:11.639 --> 00:09:13.409
the Forest Dragon was defeated.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:16.509
But not by us.

00:09:16.509 --> 00:09:21.850
Someone blew the dragon up
with a mysterious and powerful weapon.

00:09:22.009 --> 00:09:22.940
Blew up?

00:09:23.049 --> 00:09:26.879
We wanted to figure out who did it,
but we only found the trails of a carriage.

00:09:26.879 --> 00:09:29.070
That person has already left.

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:34.080
Very strong? Carriage? Already left?

00:09:34.759 --> 00:09:35.500
Al-kun!

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:42.350
My apologies. It was our momentary oversight.

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:46.110
It's fine. It's not your fault.

00:09:47.649 --> 00:09:48.830
I won't give up.

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:51.870
Just you wait and see, Al-kun.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.159
Your Highness.

00:09:54.039 --> 00:09:55.610
Please return to the royal palace immediately.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.820
That was so close...

00:10:01.669 --> 00:10:05.129
To work in the royal palace? That's absurd!

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:13.629
What? Large swarms of monsters are closing in on Meigis?!

00:10:13.879 --> 00:10:16.139
Yes, according to the reports,

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.019
orcs, dragons, golems, and pixies...

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:23.620
These different races seem to approach here
as if they are being controlled.

00:10:26.539 --> 00:10:30.980
Yes, according to the witness,
it looks like a second coming of Hellzone.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.659
Hellzone? The hellish invasion?

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.509
Once again, the monsters are...

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.409
Impossible! How is it possible?

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.529
The leader of Hellzone,

00:10:40.529 --> 00:10:44.440
Macbeth, the Demon King,
should have been killed in battle by a hero.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:47.950
Besides, to prevent that kind of
terrible war from happening again,

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.870
we have made a peace pact with the demons.

00:10:51.279 --> 00:10:53.179
Now, why...

00:10:53.299 --> 00:10:58.169
Despite that, it doesn't mean
all the demons have accepted it.

00:10:59.509 --> 00:11:00.740
Officer Cecil...

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:05.990
I think this is revenge by the demons who hate us

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.769
for defeating the Demon King.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.250
This time, the leader should be

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:17.690
the commander of the 1st Army of
the late Demon King's Combat Unit, Romeo Vandead.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:22.450
What? Wasn't he the one
who brought us the peace negotiation?

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.129
That's why he negotiated peace with us.

00:11:24.409 --> 00:11:27.519
I'm afraid he never means to have peace.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:31.340
From the very beginning, he intended
to attack us after we completely let our guard down.

00:11:33.179 --> 00:11:35.990
The dragon's assault and the princess's kidnapping

00:11:36.919 --> 00:11:38.700
are merely distractions.

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.600
But they both failed.

00:11:42.029 --> 00:11:44.850
So, they're acting out of desperation.

00:11:46.139 --> 00:11:46.850
Besides,

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:51.250
the enemies probably have noticed the hero
who has defeated the Demon King has passed away.

00:11:51.769 --> 00:11:53.230
Now we have no time to lose.

00:11:53.529 --> 00:11:55.360
Your Majesty, Your Highness,
you must leave the castle now.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:57.929
No, run away from the royal capital.

00:11:59.419 --> 00:12:03.139
How can a king abandon his people?

00:12:03.309 --> 00:12:04.840
I must stay here...

00:12:06.039 --> 00:12:11.529
I'm the one who made the peace pact
with the demons. I shall be responsible...

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:12.720
Father.

00:12:13.299 --> 00:12:15.929
No, you trusted them.

00:12:15.929 --> 00:12:17.460
After the Demon King was defeated,

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:20.740
you didn't slaughter all the demons
but treated them with benevolence.

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:22.990
I admire that very much.

00:12:23.169 --> 00:12:27.019
This spirit of benevolence is what a leader should have.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:30.590
So, I hope you can survive.

00:12:31.029 --> 00:12:32.220
Cecil.

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:37.039
Exactly. You are our king.
That's why we've been following you.

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:41.519
Losing a caring king will be a great loss for the people.

00:12:41.659 --> 00:12:44.169
The country and the people will be guarded by us.

00:12:44.659 --> 00:12:46.360
Your Majesty, please leave here.

00:12:48.029 --> 00:12:50.509
You must come back alive.

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:55.570
What a long day!

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:01.990
I put in too much strength.

00:13:02.779 --> 00:13:04.879
Fine, I'll fix it tomorrow.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.509
Hey, Al! Are you home?

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:14.080
What's wrong with the door?
The doorknob is gone!!

00:13:14.139 --> 00:13:15.029
Open the door!

00:13:17.779 --> 00:13:21.029
What's the matter, Testa? I'm exhausted today.

00:13:21.139 --> 00:13:23.470
This is no time for that!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.110
What?

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.610
A lot of monsters are passing nearby the village.

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:29.669
We must run away! Pack your things right away.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.980
What? What's going on?

00:13:32.539 --> 00:13:33.539
Hey, hold on.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.320
The crops I'll have to harvest tomorrow...

00:13:36.919 --> 00:13:39.029
Is it the time to care about those things now?

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.639
I'm sorry. You guys leave first!

00:13:42.129 --> 00:13:44.409
Anyway, there's a cave outside the village!

00:13:45.059 --> 00:13:48.049
The villagers and I will be there. You must come!

00:13:51.159 --> 00:13:53.740
Great. They're not ruined.

00:14:00.059 --> 00:14:02.480
They don't even look at the village and the vegetables.

00:14:03.149 --> 00:14:04.629
Where are they going?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.230
Is it the royal capital?

00:14:11.629 --> 00:14:13.340
No, what can I do?

00:14:14.429 --> 00:14:15.679
I'm only a farmer.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.559
This should be handled by the knights.

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:21.259
It's none of my business.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.629
(The royal capital turns into ruins)

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.590
(The logistics gets stopped)

00:14:26.799 --> 00:14:29.139
(Mass dumping)
No, it has a lot to do with me.

00:14:29.769 --> 00:14:31.379
Damn! What should I do?

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.500
Cecil, are you sure this is the right path?

00:14:38.129 --> 00:14:40.419
If my memory serves me right, it's a dead end.

00:14:43.279 --> 00:14:47.190
Let's go back. I'll scout the road with my magic.

00:14:47.289 --> 00:14:48.990
Where are we going, Cecil?

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:51.460
No...

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:53.600
This is the destination.

00:14:54.009 --> 00:14:54.850
What?

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:01.769
Cecil-sama, why?

00:15:02.139 --> 00:15:03.889
Have you turned traitor?

00:15:04.149 --> 00:15:04.889
Father!

00:15:06.419 --> 00:15:07.429
What if I did?

00:15:14.299 --> 00:15:15.759
Don't you get it?

00:15:16.139 --> 00:15:19.529
You're so pathetically foolish.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:26.809
I've been waiting for this chance.

00:15:27.129 --> 00:15:28.399
Cecil-sama?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.840
Don't you get it?

00:15:30.379 --> 00:15:32.269
There's no man named Cecil

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.629
from the very beginning.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:43.289
You are...

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.549
Romeo Vandead.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.940
Disappear! Demon!

00:15:59.789 --> 00:16:02.450
I haven't met you with this look for a long time.

00:16:02.629 --> 00:16:03.720
Your Majesty.

00:16:06.289 --> 00:16:07.039
Father...

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.340
Was everything fake?

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:14.970
No, I worked hard as a military officer.

00:16:16.179 --> 00:16:21.139
I won't do something as wasteful
as destroying a country like the Demon King did.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:24.539
A country can be of great use, after all.

00:16:25.259 --> 00:16:26.360
For example,

00:16:30.779 --> 00:16:34.259
posing as the king to rule the country.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.289
In this way,

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:43.590
the demons will occupy the Royal Capital of Meigis
without the people realizing it.

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:46.419
Isn't that nicer than destroying a country?

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:48.889
That's about it.

00:16:49.879 --> 00:16:52.519
Leave the rest to me.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:56.129
Go to hell.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.309
Guardian Shield.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:08.980
Father!

00:17:09.836 --> 00:17:10.470
I'll help you!

00:17:11.357 --> 00:17:12.642
Guardian Shield!

00:17:17.163 --> 00:17:18.836
Fal!

00:17:19.163 --> 00:17:22.309
You're quite capable, but...

00:17:35.839 --> 00:17:36.970
What strong power!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:43.890
By the way, why did both the Forest Dragon
and your kidnapping failed?

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:48.730
My plan rarely fails, you know?

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:54.200
Can you tell me reason if you know, Your Highness?

00:17:54.589 --> 00:17:56.589
I have nothing to tell you!

00:18:04.869 --> 00:18:05.549
Father!

00:18:06.299 --> 00:18:07.059
Father!!!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:12.890
Hey, the magic shield is gone, Your Highness.

00:18:17.539 --> 00:18:21.410
If I knew you were so weak, I would've come alone.

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:23.329
Boring!

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:27.289
Game over.

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.440
Overdarkness.

00:18:35.279 --> 00:18:38.880
Secret Art: Underground Excavation!

00:18:41.309 --> 00:18:43.240
Deep Plowing!!!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:53.509
Al-kun?

00:18:54.569 --> 00:18:55.349
Hi.

00:18:56.019 --> 00:18:58.500
Who are you?

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:00.359
I am

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:02.220
a farmer!!

00:19:05.589 --> 00:19:06.730
Farmer?

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:10.529
How can a farmer dodge my move?

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:14.150
Oh, that was called Deep Plowing.

00:19:14.299 --> 00:19:17.200
It's a technique to replace the soil
on the surface with soil from deeper layer.

00:19:17.769 --> 00:19:20.019
Using the same soil

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:23.869
will reduce the nutrition and microbes
in the soil, so the plants will tend to get sick.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:29.069
Well, you only need to plow this deep
for vegetables with deep roots.

00:19:29.799 --> 00:19:34.579
Right, it also depends on the vegetable types,
but the depth is basically about 30 centimeters...

00:19:34.579 --> 00:19:35.769
I didn't ask you about that!

00:19:37.589 --> 00:19:38.490
Go to hell!

00:19:40.809 --> 00:19:41.950
That was close.

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:43.099
What?

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:53.220
Hey, hey. I'm impressed.

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:56.910
You were the one who sabotaged my plans, right?

00:19:58.009 --> 00:20:01.740
If it was really you, I'm so happy to meet you here.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:15.309
I was merely playing with you just now, you shitty brat!

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.890
This is my real appearance!

00:20:20.329 --> 00:20:23.789
Look at this! Do you think you can beat me?

00:20:24.809 --> 00:20:26.849
I'll crush you!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.990
His status...

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:32.079
No way... Level 78!

00:20:33.309 --> 00:20:36.720
Al-kun, his status is too crazy! Run!

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.180
Too late!

00:20:40.359 --> 00:20:43.769
You forced me to exert all my strength!
Go regret this in hell!

00:20:43.799 --> 00:20:44.619
Al-kun!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.920
Go to hell!

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.740
Romeo-sama...

00:21:01.609 --> 00:21:03.269
He got him with just one hit.

00:21:07.069 --> 00:21:08.480
So, as for the rest...

00:21:14.019 --> 00:21:14.930
What?

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:23.220
Al-kun, you saved us. Thank you so much!

00:21:23.809 --> 00:21:27.680
The monsters also retreated after Romeo was defeated.

00:21:28.029 --> 00:21:31.930
Thanks to you, the country, the people,
and my retainers are all safe.

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:33.740
I don't know how to thank you.

00:21:33.859 --> 00:21:35.170
Not at all.

00:21:35.549 --> 00:21:40.809
I just don't want my vegetables to get damaged
or lose the only place to sell them.

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.430
By the way, Al-dono.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.750
I have a suggestion. Could you consider it?

00:21:48.579 --> 00:21:50.420
Well, it doesn't feel...

00:21:50.849 --> 00:21:52.069
good.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:54.289
I've got to go. I have some farm work to do.

00:21:54.289 --> 00:21:55.309
Wait!

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:57.829
Are you willing to serve the country?

00:21:58.029 --> 00:21:59.250
I knew it.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:02.779
No, I'm only a farmer.

00:22:03.259 --> 00:22:06.230
Please. Having you alone
is equivalent to having 100 people.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:07.650
Honorary Commander,

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:10.720
or any other titles, I can grant it to you.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:15.109
It won't work, Father.
Al-kun isn't interested in any position or honor.

00:22:15.619 --> 00:22:16.299
Am I right?

00:22:16.569 --> 00:22:20.579
Yeah, I'm sorry. I've made up
my mind to be a farmer all my life.

00:22:20.990 --> 00:22:22.200
I understand.

00:22:22.839 --> 00:22:25.240
I'll recruit you once in a while.

00:22:25.730 --> 00:22:27.279
You still won't give up.

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.569
However, in gratitude for your help this time,

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:32.130
we hope you will accept the 33,000 square meters field.

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:34.000
Oh, really?

00:22:34.029 --> 00:22:37.319
Yeah. In exchange, can you register at the guild?

00:22:37.400 --> 00:22:38.170
Guild?

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:44.000
Yeah, the royal capital and its neighborhood
are still under threat from monsters.

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:47.210
I hope you can help us sometimes.

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:54.890
Alright. Since you gave me
the farm land, I should help out too.

00:22:55.559 --> 00:22:57.900
It's a deal then. I hope we can get along.

00:22:58.410 --> 00:22:59.220
Al Wayne.

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:05.759
And so, I've started to work on the fields
and crusade against monsters in the royal capital.

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:14.480
A fulfilling farm life still seems far away from me.

00:23:15.079 --> 00:23:18.619
Isn't this a wasteland?!

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:40.019
(Episode 2 The Farmer and the Guild)
